# ==============================================================================
# LAND RECORDS PROJECT - ROOT ENVIRONMENT REFERENCE
# ==============================================================================
# This project has two sub-projects requiring environment configuration:
#
# 1. CLIENT (Next.js Frontend & Auth Backend):
#    Location: client/.env.local
#    Template: client/.env.example
#    Action:   cd client && cp .env.example .env.local
#              (Fill in MongoDB URI, Pinata, and SMTP credentials)
#
# 2. FABRIC API (Hyperledger Fabric REST Bridge):
#    Location: fabric-api/.env
#    Template: fabric-api/.env.example
#    Action:   cd fabric-api && cp .env.example .env
#              (Default PORT=3001, dynamic paths are auto-discovered)
#
# NOTE: Never commit '.env', '.env.local', or secrets to Git!
# ==============================================================================
